n of decreasing $x$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (0,1).\n$$" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342192 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342193 13194139535292 true] [17592186342192 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535292 true] [17592186342192 1041 "field-1" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342192 1104 #edb/ref 17592186342193 13194139535292 true] [17592186342192 1110 #uuid "37bd74e5-89bc-50e9-aea2-da380eb0c729" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342193 1034 "0" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342193 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535292 true] [17592186342193 1111 #uuid "cffe0db4-61fd-5cb1-aa4a-c9db7f51f30e" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342194 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342195 13194139535292 true] [17592186342194 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535292 true] [17592186342194 1041 "field-2" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342194 1104 #edb/ref 17592186342195 13194139535292 true] [17592186342194 1110 #uuid "361d2fd6-e3c4-5fba-a2a1-5695993a232c" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342195 1034 "1" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342195 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535292 true] [17592186342195 1111 #uuid "569216e1-1ce8-59e5-8279-a03ef1a834ce" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342196 1017 #edb/ref 17592186342197 13194139535292 true] [17592186342196 1017 #edb/ref 17592186342200 13194139535292 true] [17592186342196 1089 "q-335909" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342196 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535292 true] [17592186342196 1100 "A particle $P$ is traveling along the $x$-axis with displacement $s(t)$ from a fixed origin $O$ given by\n\n$$\ns(t)=(4t-8){e}^{t},\\,t\\ge 0.\n$$\n\nFind the time at which the acceleration is zero, and find the value of the velocity at this moment.\n\nThe acceleration is zero at $t=$\n{{field-1}}, and the velocity at this moment is\n$v=$\n{{field-2}}." 13194139535292 true] [17592186342196 1113 #uuid "a24f294a-cdfd-53bd-ae89-48540ff56558" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342196 1145 "First, we calculate $v(t)$ by differentiating $s(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}((4t-8){e}^{t}) \\\\  & =4{e}^{t}+(4t-8){e}^{t} \\\\  & =(4t-4){e}^{t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we differentiate $v(t)$ to find $a(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}((4t-4){e}^{t}) \\\\  & =4{e}^{t}+(4t-4){e}^{t} \\\\  & =4t\\,{e}^{t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we put $a=0$ to find the time when the acceleration is zero:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4t\\,{e}^{t} & =0 \\\\ 4t & =0 \\\\ t & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the acceleration is zero when $t=0.$ To find the velocity at this moment, we substitute this back into $v(t)$ to get\n\n$$\nv(0)=(4\\cdot 0-4){e}^{0}=-4.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the acceleration is zero at $t=0,$ and the velocity at this moment is $v=-4.$" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342197 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342198 13194139535292 true] [17592186342197 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342199 13194139535292 true] [17592186342197 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535292 true] [17592186342197 1041 "field-1" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342197 1104 #edb/ref 17592186342199 13194139535292 true] [17592186342197 1110 #uuid "207287d5-fe5f-54d4-9e75-b69d3ed6b33c" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342198 1034 "1" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342198 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535292 true] [17592186342198 1111 #uuid "0296cc2f-3d1f-5bb4-9d36-9b7d30ca6fd1" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342199 1034 "0" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342199 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535292 true] [17592186342199 1111 #uuid "31422fc6-6905-5940-b539-138e57462499" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342201 13194139535292 true] [17592186342200 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535292 true] [17592186342200 1041 "field-2" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342200 1104 #edb/ref 17592186342201 13194139535292 true] [17592186342200 1110 #uuid "1b7b5179-aec4-5b43-bb47-ed04fb2f4730" 13194139535292 true] [17592186342201 1034 "-4" 13194139535292 true] [17